Cell["\<\
The displayed order is identical to orbitalTable and to the full \
representation matrices.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ee012083-99df-4fa7-89d3-2840806a6280"],

Cell["\<\
For H[[i,j]], column j is the initial ket and row i is the final bra. In \
Induced mode the table also shows how a reference-site state was transported \
to an equivalent site.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5d89064b-2c07-44bd-bd30-b5b322449697"]
}, Closed]],

